  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 2502.03 Tinted Windows to the Left and Right of the Driver",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 2502.03 Tinted Windows to the Left and Right of the Driver. Pursuant to RSA 266:58-a, III, after market tinting on the windows to the left and right of the driver shall not be prohibited as long as the windows have a light transmittance of not less than 70 percent.\n\nSource. #13416, eff 7-25-22; ss by #14382, eff 9-20-25, EXPIRES: 9-20-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c2500.html"
